From 7063521b5fb01f12f9a57d73e3c7d50fc342b821 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev Prashant <dev.prashant1901@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:16:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(connectors): add the UCI hydraulic systems condition
 monitoring dataset

Add uci/hydraulic, a connector for UCI dataset 447, "Condition monitoring
of hydraulic systems" (ZeMA gGmbH, CC BY 4.0). The archive is pinned by
SHA-256.

Each of the 2,205 load cycles becomes one Record with 17 Signals grouped
into seven sensor Sources. Every Signal keeps its native rate on its own
regular axis (100 Hz, 10 Hz or 1 Hz) with no resampling. Each cycle gets
one ClassificationTask per component (cooler, valve, internal pump
leakage, hydraulic accumulator) with ordered, readable label sets, and
carries the profile.txt grades and stable flag as annotations.

The release has no official partition. StratifiedSplitter assigns
80/10/10 folds with seed 42, grouped by the four-grade condition so near
copies of a cycle never cross partitions, and stratified by the
accumulator grade. Conversion fails if the train partition misses any
grade of any component.
